<title>UK: World Bank sets 100 mln Polish zloty 2-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 100 mln Polish zloty 2-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN PLZ   COUPON     19.5	MATURITY    17.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.825   PAY DATE    17.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  5-20-200</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/PO/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  0.825     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
</text>
